<title>HONG KONG: Indesen Ind year net loss HK$18.58 mln.</title>
<headline>Indesen Ind year net loss HK$18.58 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.4 loss   vs  6.7 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.60 loss  vs  2.94 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    18.58 loss vs  16.72 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     169.76     vs  79.43</p>
<p>    Company name		 Indesen Industries Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 3-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Indesen Industries is a video cassette manufacturer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on write-off of interests in an associated company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
